# Firebase Backend

## Firebase Services Used

- **Auth** — email/password authentication
- **Firestore** — document database (all app data)
- **Storage** — sermon audio files, event images, profile photos
- **Analytics** — initialized in `services/firebase.js`
- **Hosting** — SPA deployment from `dist/`

## Firestore Data Models

### `users/{uid}`
```
{
  uid: string,
  email: string,
  displayName: string,
  role: "member" | "admin",
  createdAt: Timestamp
}
```

### `events/{eventId}`
```
{
  title: string,
  description: string,
  details?: string,
  date: Timestamp,
  location: string,
  imageUrl?: string,
  registrationUrl?: string,
  createdAt: Timestamp,
  updatedAt: Timestamp
}
```

### `sermons/{sermonId}`
```
{
  title: string,
  speaker: string,
  date: Timestamp,
  category: "Sunday Message" | "Bible Study" | "Special Series" | "Guest Speaker",
  scripture?: string,
  description?: string,
  videoUrl?: string,          // YouTube or direct video URL
  audioUrl?: string,          // Firebase Storage URL
  thumbnailUrl?: string,
  notesUrl?: string,
  createdAt: Timestamp,
  updatedAt: Timestamp
}
```

### `contactMessages/{msgId}`
```
{
  firstName: string,
  lastName: string,
  email: string,
  phone?: string,
  subject: string,
  message: string,
  status: "unread",
  createdAt: Timestamp
}
```

### `prayerRequests/{reqId}`
```
{
  name?: string,
  email?: string,
  request: string,
  isPrivate?: boolean,
  status: "active",
  createdAt: Timestamp
}
```

### `churchProfileUpdates/{docId}`
```
{
  officialName: string,
  amharicName?: string,
  address: string,
  phone?: string,
  email?: string,
  serviceTimes: string,
  foundedYear?: string,
  pastorName?: string,
  leadershipTeam?: string,
  attendanceEstimate?: string,
  languagesUsed?: string,
  ministryPrograms?: string,
  socialLinks?: string,
  legalNameOrEntity?: string,
  ownershipOrLeaseInfo?: string,
  announcements?: string,
  prayerNeeds?: string,
  additionalNotes?: string,
  submittedByUid: string,
  submittedByEmail: string | null,
  submittedAt: Timestamp,
  status: "new"
}
```

## Security Rules Summary

| Collection | Read | Create | Update/Delete |
|-----------|------|--------|---------------|
| `users/{uid}` | Owner or admin | Auth user (own doc) | Owner or admin |
| `events` | Public | Admin | Admin |
| `sermons` | Public | Admin | Admin |
| `contactMessages` | Admin | Anyone (public) | Admin |
| `prayerRequests` | Admin | Anyone (public) | Admin |
| `churchProfileUpdates` | Admin | Any auth user | Admin |

Admin check reads from `users/{uid}.role == 'admin'`.

## Storage Paths

| Path | Public Read | Write |
|------|-----------|-------|
| `sermons/audio/{sermonId}/{filename}` | Yes | Admin |
| `events/{allPaths}` | Yes | Admin |
| `profiles/{uid}/{allPaths}` | Yes | Owner or admin |

## Firestore Indexes

1. `events` — `date ASC`
2. `sermons` — `category ASC, date DESC` (for category filter)
3. `sermons` — `date DESC` (for default listing)

## Service Files

| File | Responsibility |
|------|---------------|
| `firebase.js` | Initialize app, export `auth`, `db`, `storage`, `analytics` |
| `authService.js` | Register, login, logout, password reset, get profile, auth state listener |
| `eventsService.js` | CRUD for events collection |
| `sermonsService.js` | CRUD for sermons + audio upload to Storage |
| `contactService.js` | Submit contact form and prayer requests |
| `missingDataService.js` | Submit church profile updates |
